！一定是你在撒谎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADA4A86CF3874E30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064104007:1":{"text":"艾、艾雅在上……阿塔利娅大人，总算跟上您了！","source_cn":"艾、艾雅在上……阿塔利娅大人，总算跟上您了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF0FAA838CD568FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1064104008:1":{"text":"……您、您为什么要拿武器对准埃米妮？她是列罗的妻子，是受害者啊！","source_cn":"……您、您为什么要拿武器对准埃米妮？她是列罗的妻子，是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE03A8C57CBE0BDAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064104009:1":{"text":"尸体上的黑魔法，是她施加的。","source_cn":"尸体上的黑魔法，是她施加的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x807063A5F9FB93C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064104010:1":{"text":"她已堕入邪恶，必须清除。","source_cn":"她已堕入邪恶，必须清除。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F004AF59BC8D98B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064104011:1":{"text":"黑魔法？不，阿塔利娅大人，埃米妮只是一个无辜的普通人，这其中一定有什么误会。","source_cn":"黑魔法？不，阿塔利娅大人，埃米妮只是一个无辜的普通人，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2AE0DC85C153A03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_reco