:"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064104017:0":{"text":"不，她说的没错……所有一切，都是因为我的错……","source_cn":"不，她说的没错……所有一切，都是因为我的错……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x554F5830C08D106A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064104018:0":{"text":"如果不是我年轻时犯下了那么多罪，我的家人也不会遭到如今的报应……","source_cn":"如果不是我年轻时犯下了那么多罪，我的家人也不会遭到如今...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E04D83B915116F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064104019:0":{"text":"你既已认罪，就接受裁决，偿还你的罪孽。","source_cn":"你既已认罪，就接受裁决，偿还你的罪孽。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x561F6DC39C099E90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064104020:1":{"text":"这是女神恩赐给你的，最后的怜悯——","source_cn":"这是女神恩赐给你的，最后的怜悯——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBB4237D7F8E7145","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064104021:0":{"text":"不——！请等一等！","source_cn":"不——！请等一等！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C4BE1B7B79648BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1064104022:1":{"text":"路易莎修女？！你腿脚不便，怎么还是赶过来了？","source_cn":"路易莎修女？！你腿脚不便，怎么还是赶过来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh